{"id":"070cc23caeb65b77","group":"89","path":"89/89-ex-solovay-construction.md","title":"Solovay Construction","display":"ex-solovay-construction — Solovay Construction","type":"example","metadata":{"type":"example","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-ex-solovay-construction","aliases":["89-ex-solovay-construction"],"display":"ex-solovay-construction — Solovay Construction","depends_on":["[[89-df-solovay-function]]","[[89-df-solovay-realization]]","[[89-df-consistent-pa]]","[[89-df-pa-provable-formula]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"example"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-ex-solovay-construction"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-ex-solovay-construction</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"ex-solovay-construction — Solovay Construction"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"b2b62c1bcece60ed\" href=\"?note=b2b62c1bcece60ed\" title=\"89-df-solovay-function\">89-df-solovay-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"97b68cd750e79cac\" href=\"?note=97b68cd750e79cac\" title=\"89-df-solovay-realization\">89-df-solovay-realization</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"8c9363f0c1d91236\" href=\"?note=8c9363f0c1d91236\" title=\"89-df-consistent-pa\">89-df-consistent-pa</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"8f382173effd5662\" href=\"?note=8f382173effd5662\" title=\"89-df-pa-provable-formula\">89-df-pa-provable-formula</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M_{0}=(\\{w_{0}\\},\\varnothing,V)\">\\(M_{0}=(\\{w_{0}\\},\\varnothing,V)\\)</span> is the one-world finite GL model,\nwith <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V(p)=\\varnothing\">\\(V(p)=\\varnothing\\)</span> for the displayed <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\in\\mathrm{Prop}\">\\(p\\in\\mathrm{Prop}\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\">\\(\\sigma\\)</span> is the Solovay function starting at <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w_0\">\\(w_0\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau_{\\sigma}\">\\(\\tau_{\\sigma}\\)</span>\nis the realization built from the same ordered model and sentence family.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cons}(\\mathrm{PA})\">\\(\\mathrm{Cons}(\\mathrm{PA})\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PForm}_{\\mathrm{PA}}\">\\(\\mathrm{PForm}_{\\mathrm{PA}}\\)</span> are the\nconsistency predicate and PA-provable-sentence set.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ex\\text{-}solovay\\text{-}construction}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;(\\sigma(n)=w_{0}),\\\\\n&amp;r_{\\sigma}(p)=\\bot_{\\mathrm{PA}},\\\\\n&amp;\\tau_{\\sigma}(p)=\\bot_{\\mathrm{PA}},\\\\\n&amp;\\mathrm{Cons}(\\mathrm{PA})\n\\Longrightarrow\n\\tau_{\\sigma}(p)\\notin\\mathrm{PForm}_{\\mathrm{PA}}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{ex\\text{-}solovay\\text{-}construction}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;(\\sigma(n)=w_{0}),\\\\\n&amp;r_{\\sigma}(p)=\\bot_{\\mathrm{PA}},\\\\\n&amp;\\tau_{\\sigma}(p)=\\bot_{\\mathrm{PA}},\\\\\n&amp;\\mathrm{Cons}(\\mathrm{PA})\n\\Longrightarrow\n\\tau_{\\sigma}(p)\\notin\\mathrm{PForm}_{\\mathrm{PA}}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>唯一世界没有后继，故候选集始终为空，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\">\\(\\sigma\\)</span> 永远停在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w_{0}\">\\(w_{0}\\)</span></li>\n<li>因 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V(p)=\\varnothing\">\\(V(p)=\\varnothing\\)</span>，Solovay 实现把 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\">\\(p\\)</span> 解释为矛盾式</li>\n<li>最后一行正是 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"8c9363f0c1d91236\" href=\"?note=8c9363f0c1d91236\" title=\"89-df-consistent-pa\">89-df-consistent-pa</a> 在\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau_{\\sigma}(p)=\\bot_{\\mathrm{PA}}\">\\(\\tau_{\\sigma}(p)=\\bot_{\\mathrm{PA}}\\)</span> 下的实例。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-solovay-function","status":"resolved","id":"b2b62c1bcece60ed","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-solovay-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-solovay-realization","status":"resolved","id":"97b68cd750e79cac","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-solovay-realization]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-consistent-pa","status":"resolved","id":"8c9363f0c1d91236","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-consistent-pa]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-pa-provable-formula","status":"resolved","id":"8f382173effd5662","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-pa-provable-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-consistent-pa","status":"resolved","id":"8c9363f0c1d91236","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"最后一行正是 [[89-df-consistent-pa]] 在\n$\\tau_{\\sigma}(p)=\\bot_{\\mathrm{PA}}$ 下的实例。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"M_{0}=(\\{w_{0}\\},\\varnothing,V)","display":false},{"tex":"V(p)=\\varnothing","display":false},{"tex":"p\\in\\mathrm{Prop}","display":false},{"tex":"\\sigma","display":false},{"tex":"w_0","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau_{\\sigma}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Cons}(\\mathrm{PA})","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PForm}_{\\mathrm{PA}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ex\\text{-}solovay\\text{-}construction}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n&\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;(\\sigma(n)=w_{0}),\\\\\n&r_{\\sigma}(p)=\\bot_{\\mathrm{PA}},\\\\\n&\\tau_{\\sigma}(p)=\\bot_{\\mathrm{PA}},\\\\\n&\\mathrm{Cons}(\\mathrm{PA})\n\\Longrightarrow\n\\tau_{\\sigma}(p)\\notin\\mathrm{PForm}_{\\mathrm{PA}}.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\sigma","display":false},{"tex":"w_{0}","display":false},{"tex":"V(p)=\\varnothing","display":false},{"tex":"p","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau_{\\sigma}(p)=\\bot_{\\mathrm{PA}}","display":false}],"bytes":1445,"backlinks":[],"outgoing":["b2b62c1bcece60ed","97b68cd750e79cac","8c9363f0c1d91236","8f382173effd5662"]}